{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>厭倦了千篇一律的鬧鐘鈴聲？《VoiceWake》讓你在 App 內直接錄下真人聲音，再把這段錄音設為鬧鐘；你可以用孩子的摯友聲音叫醒孩子，也可以讓重要的人陪你展開一天。軟件原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，適合想擺脫冰冷提示音、重視私隱及不希望被廣告打擾的 iOS 用戶。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-54.webp\">\n<h2>錄製專屬語音鬧鐘</h2>\n<p>在 App 內即可完成錄音，無需匯入檔案；你還可以建立一個小小的語音庫，日後重複選用。設定時間、挑選重複日子、再選一把聲音，鬧鐘便會以該段錄音響起來。即使手機處於靜音或專注模式，鬧鐘依然會響，避免睡過頭。使用過程無需帳戶，亦沒有廣告，所有錄音只保留在你的裝置上。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-105-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-106-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-107-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-108-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：VoiceWake</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T20:44:22.221831+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":324,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T20:37:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T01:39:18.414989+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T20:38:28.344044+00:00","content_hash":"5b7faa85150ce6f7914f43f60ed9825576d30bcd871e6ad3b25d10284e5fd705","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}